WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.909 --> 00:00:09.599
If your school has a Fixer Nation license but you haven't been sent an invitation, you can register yourself with your school email. Here's how.

2
00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:16.691
On the Teacher Registration page, enter your first name, last name, and your school email address.

3
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:27.470
Select Check Eligibility. We match the part of your email after the at sign to your school's license. If your school has a seat available, we hold one for you right away.

4
00:00:27.971 --> 00:00:35.931
You'll be asked which grade levels you teach. Tick the ones that apply and select Continue. This is optional, and you can skip it.

5
00:00:36.433 --> 00:00:40.853
You'll see a message that your seat is reserved. Select Create Account.

6
00:00:41.353 --> 00:00:50.113
A sign up window opens with your email filled in. Enter your name, choose a password with at least eight characters, and select Sign Up.

7
00:00:50.614 --> 00:00:57.154
Then check your email for a message from us, and select the link inside. It works for twenty four hours.

8
00:00:57.656 --> 00:01:03.796
Once your address is verified, sign in on the Teacher Login page with your email and password.

9
00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:12.617
If your school doesn't have a license yet, or the license isn't active, or all the seats are in use, you'll see a message that says so.

10
00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:21.350
Select Notify School Admin, and we'll email your school's administrator for you. You can also buy a single teacher license of your own.
